    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain McSpacebiff is a first person shooter/ third person brawler, action game set in a wacky atom-punk universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against the dastardly foes of an Alien Planet and the Soviet Moonion armed with nothing but your fists and a wide array of other deadly weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of third person brawler and first person shooter combat with your friends. Enemies utilize both ranged and melee weapons so plan your attack and defense carefully. Choose the right weapon for each situation to efficiently dispense freedom upon the enemies of Planet America! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brave Captain in Planet America's Stellar Navy. <br>You've been sent solo on a reconnaissance mission across space and time to solve the mystery of a lost colony in the far reaches of the known universe. <br><br>When you arrive you find the remnants of the colony are in desperate need of help against two familiar foes: The Soviet Moonion and their own incompetence...<br><br>This is no surprise and falls well within the expected mission parameters, however there is another new threat looming in the dark reaches of unmapped space that could threaten Planet America\u2019s very existence, and even the existence of Freedom itself.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain McSpacebiff is a first person shooter/ third person brawler, action game set in a wacky atom-punk universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against the dastardly foes of an Alien Planet and the Soviet Moonion armed with nothing but your fists and a wide array of other deadly weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of third person brawler and first person shooter combat with your friends. Enemies utilize both ranged and melee weapons so plan your attack and defense carefully. Choose the right weapon for each situation to efficiently dispense freedom upon the enemies of Planet America! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brave Captain in Planet America's Stellar Navy. <br>You've been sent solo on a reconnaissance mission across space and time to solve the mystery of a lost colony in the far reaches of the known universe. <br><br>When you arrive you find the remnants of the colony are in desperate need of help against two familiar foes: The Soviet Moonion and their own incompetence...<br><br>This is no surprise and falls well within the expected mission parameters, however there is another new threat looming in the dark reaches of unmapped space that could threaten Planet America\u2019s very existence, and even the existence of Freedom itself.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hot-swap between 1st person shooting and 3rd person brawling in this Atom Punk styled adventure. Collect crashed ship parts to gain new abilities, save the doofy locals and vanquish the Soviet Moonion!",
